# Files NOT uploaded to Vercel. Everything here is excluded from the cloud
# build, so it must never be imported by shipped code.

# The MUI template's component showcase: 121 of the app's 201 routes, and pure
# dev reference (root CLAUDE.md marks it for pruning before launch). Nothing
# outside it imports it and the sidebar menu does not link it, so it ships
# nothing — but static-generating it dominated the build, which runs with
# `experimental.cpus: 1` (see apps/web/next.config.mjs: the 8 GB build
# container OOMs with parallel workers, so routes are generated serially).
# Keep the source in git for local reference at http://localhost:3000/ui.
apps/web/src/app/(dashboard)/ui
